  tip Follow the road east to the Green Belt; Rethiel the Greenwarden stands by the river.
  accept 277
  accept 98283 optional               -- Rethiel the Greenwarden: Carnage, an elite raptor

step Crude Flint
  zone Wetlands
  tip Mosshide Fenrunners and Mistweavers roam the riverbanks just west and south of Rethiel; almost every one drops flint.
  collect 2611 quest 277

step Rethiel the Greenwarden
  turnin 277
  accept 275

step The Green Belt: kill these as you meet them
  zone Wetlands
  tip Red whelps fill the hills west of the gates, Maddened Rotclaws the Green Belt, Razormaws the northern slopes; Neru stands in the north-east (use the Goaz Stone).
  tip Carnage is elite: grouping up is advised.
  tip Fen Creepers hide in the marsh pools north-west of the Green Belt.
  tip Careful: When out of combat, Fen Creepers cast Sneak from time to time, so they are stealthed and hard to see.
  collect 280331 quest 98283.1 optional -- Malignant Rotclaw Flesh
  kill 1040 quest 275 @24.46,33.18 map 1437 era

